WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.650
A baby girl has just been born.

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:06.510
Someone leans close and
whispers into her right ear.

3
00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:10.150
The words are the adhan:
the call to prayer.

4
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:14.490
At the other end of life, the body
is wrapped in simple white cloths,

5
00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:16.560
rich and poor alike.

6
00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:22.010
So why are the first words a Muslim baby
hears the same as the call to prayer?

7
00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:26.760
In this mission, you'll follow the
first 7 days of a Muslim child's life.

8
00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:30.480
Then you'll trace a marriage
contract signed before witnesses,

9
00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:33.240
and a funeral, step by step.

10
00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:38.430
Your mission: explain why a Muslim baby's
first words are the call to prayer.
